{"clip_id": "Eng_002290", "text_verbatim": "and now words and their stories from VOA learning English.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002291", "text_verbatim": "Every day, we do countless things with our hands.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002292", "text_verbatim": "So, it's not surprising that we have many hand expressions that describe how we do something.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002293", "text_verbatim": "These hand expressions could be called handy.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002294", "text_verbatim": "Meaning, they are useful.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002295", "text_verbatim": "When we do something with our bare hands, we do it on our own.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002296", "text_verbatim": "Usually with much effort.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002297", "text_verbatim": "When we use this expression, we are expressing pride in something we have done.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002298", "text_verbatim": "For example, let's say I decided to build my own gardening shed.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002299", "text_verbatim": "A small outdoor building for gardening supplies.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002300", "text_verbatim": "It was hard work.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002301", "text_verbatim": "and took me days to finish.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002302", "text_verbatim": "But, at the end of the project, I could proudly say that I built it with my own bare hands.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002303", "text_verbatim": "Feeling proud and finishing a big project, go hand in hand.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002304", "text_verbatim": "They go together.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002305", "text_verbatim": "Let's say you are asked to lead a project.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002306", "text_verbatim": "You want it to be successful.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002307", "text_verbatim": "You want it to be on time and on budget.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002308", "text_verbatim": "So, you lead with a firm hand.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002309", "text_verbatim": "If you lead with a firm hand, you are strict.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002310", "text_verbatim": "You follow all the rules closely.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002311", "text_verbatim": "Teachers can teach with a firm hand.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002312", "text_verbatim": "and parents can parent with a firm hand too.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002313", "text_verbatim": "having a firm hand and being strict, go hand in hand.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002314", "text_verbatim": "A firm hand is not the same as a heavy hand.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002315", "text_verbatim": "If a person or organization has a heavy hand,", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002316", "text_verbatim": "They use a lot of force or power to control people and events.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002317", "text_verbatim": "A heavy hand is often considered a bad thing.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002318", "text_verbatim": "When you deal with a situation with a heavy hand...", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002319", "text_verbatim": "You could be seen as oppressive.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002320", "text_verbatim": "Someone who is heavy-handed is severe or harsh when dealing with others or when dealing with a situation.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002321", "text_verbatim": "Sometimes we call this an iron hand or even an iron fist.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002322", "text_verbatim": "A fist is a closed hand that is used for hitting.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002323", "text_verbatim": "Now, what kind of person has a high hand?", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002324", "text_verbatim": "Someone who has a high hand is domineering.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002325", "text_verbatim": "They like to be in control.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002326", "text_verbatim": "They are bossy.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002327", "text_verbatim": "Sometimes we use the adjective, high-handed.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002328", "text_verbatim": "High-handed people do not consider the rights, concerns, thoughts or feelings of others.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002329", "text_verbatim": "They look down on people.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002330", "text_verbatim": "In other words, they are arrogant and condescending.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002331", "text_verbatim": "Hand expressions can also describe our involvement in a situation.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002332", "text_verbatim": "A friend of yours asks you to find a manager for her company.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002333", "text_verbatim": "But you don't know anyone who fits the job description.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002334", "text_verbatim": "You don't have a hand in the selection.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002335", "text_verbatim": "If you have a hand in something, you have helped to make it happen.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002336", "text_verbatim": "Your friend was able to find someone for the job through another person.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002337", "text_verbatim": "Someone you know.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002338", "text_verbatim": "Let's call him Bob.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002339", "text_verbatim": "So, you warn your friend.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002340", "text_verbatim": "But they don't take the warning seriously.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002341", "text_verbatim": "In the end, Bob is a terrible choice.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002342", "text_verbatim": "He steals a lot of money from your friend's company.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002343", "text_verbatim": "Your friend is furious.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002344", "text_verbatim": "But in this matter, your hands are clean.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002345", "text_verbatim": "You did nothing wrong.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002346", "text_verbatim": "In fact, you tried to warn your friend.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002347", "text_verbatim": "We use this expression to state innocence in a bad situation.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002348", "text_verbatim": "Here's another example.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002349", "text_verbatim": "Let's say you are babysitting some children.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002350", "text_verbatim": "They want to make a cake.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002351", "text_verbatim": "and they make a total mess in the kitchen.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002352", "text_verbatim": "Flower, sugar and broken eggs are everywhere.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002353", "text_verbatim": "When their parents come home and see the mess...", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002354", "text_verbatim": "You can say you did not have a hand in it.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002355", "text_verbatim": "The kids did it all.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002356", "text_verbatim": "All you did was turn on the oven.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002357", "text_verbatim": "Maybe these kids do this every time you watch them.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002358", "text_verbatim": "You were tired of it.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002359", "text_verbatim": "Even though they do make tasty cake.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002360", "text_verbatim": "So, you throw your hands up.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002361", "text_verbatim": "When you throw your hands up, you are tired of fighting something.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002362", "text_verbatim": "It is a sign that you give up.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002363", "text_verbatim": "A good word that describes this feeling is exasperation.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002364", "text_verbatim": "People who are exasperated are tired of something, and they often throw their hands in the air.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_002365", "text_verbatim": "And that's the end of this Words and Their Stories.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
